title: $:/plugins/rimir/drop-attach/settings
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki

\whitespace trim

!! Drop attach

Drop binary files onto a tiddler, or click a tiddler and paste. See the <<tag "readme">> and documentation tabs.

<table class="rr-table">
<tr><th>Setting</th><th>Value</th></tr>
<tr><td>New tiddler title (filter; `<target>`, `<filename>`, `<type>`, `<source>`, `<size>`)</td><td><$edit-text tiddler="$:/config/rimir/drop-attach/title-filter" tag="input" class="rr-input" style="width:100%"/></td></tr>
<tr><td>Append a view of the attachment to the end of the tiddler it was dropped on (an `<<attachment>>` card)</td><td><$checkbox tiddler="$:/config/rimir/drop-attach/append" field="text" checked="yes" unchecked="no" default="yes"> append</$checkbox></td></tr>
<tr><td>Size limit per file (MB)</td><td><$edit-text tiddler="$:/config/rimir/drop-attach/max-size" tag="input" class="rr-input" style="width:80px"/></td></tr>
<tr><td>Name of pasted files (filter; `<ext>`, `<type>`)</td><td><$edit-text tiddler="$:/config/rimir/drop-attach/paste-name" tag="input" class="rr-input" style="width:100%"/></td></tr>
</table>

!! Extra file types

One `<mime type> <.extension>` per line; `#` starts a comment. Takes effect after a restart.

<$edit-text tiddler="$:/config/rimir/drop-attach/extra-types" tag="textarea" class="rr-input" style="width:100%" rows="6"/>

!! After-upload actions

Tiddlers tagged <<tag "$:/tags/rimir/drop-attach/action">> run for every attached file, in tag order.

<$list filter="[all[shadows+tiddlers]tag[$:/tags/rimir/drop-attach/action]!is[draft]]" emptyMessage="''None''">
<div><$link/> <code><$text text={{!!text}}/></code></div>
</$list>

!! Drop targets

<$list filter="[all[shadows+tiddlers]tag[$:/tags/rimir/drop-attach/target]!is[draft]]">
<div><$link/>: <code><$text text={{!!selector}}/></code></div>
</$list>
